.TH RATASH-RULE-REMOVE 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.1" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-rule\-remove \- Remove one exact, complete Rule String
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash rule remove\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIRULE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove one exact, complete Rule String
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIRULE\fR>
Exact, complete Rule String to remove
